  "foaf:name": "Digital REconstruction of Abyssal habitat Map",
  "sdo:name": "Digital REconstruction of Abyssal habitat Map",
  "sdo:description": "The DREAM initiative, in sync with the UN&#x27;s Ocean Decade and Digital DEPTH, targets deep-sea habitats like seamounts and ridges. It seeks to boost observation tech, streamline data processing, and innovate with AI for accurate seafloor mapping. DREAM&#x27;s goals include: (1) enhancing observation systems with underwater vehicles for detailed deep-sea monitoring; (2) building a data fusion platform using global and local data to craft AI tools; (3) setting up a standardized platform for versatile habitat mapping; and (4) offering public services like ocean modeling. The outcomes will enrich public knowledge and marine science.",
  "sdo:location": "China",
  "sdo:identifier": "37.7",
  "sdo:url": "https://oceandecade.org/actions/digital-reconstruction-of-abyssal-habitat-map/",
